# Build output and IDE state
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
*.user

# Machine-specific configuration containing secrets such as connection strings and passwords.
# Create it by copying appsettings.Local.json.template (checked in) and filling in your values.
#
# RULE: every ignored file that a program needs must have a checked-in copy template named
# "<original file name>.template" (secrets removed, every setting explained). Templates are never ignored.
appsettings.Local.json
!*.template
